      "writtenOn": "2024-08-29T10:49:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done.\n\nandroid.permission.USE_CUSTOM_VIRTUAL_MACHINE is signature|development permission, which means that it can be granted to an app through adb shell grant command (test/debug case), or if an app is signed with the same signature as com.android.virt APEX (VM owned by platform case).",
